# Hardbristle Bandit: "{T}: Add one mana of any color." pays for a Lightning Bolt at Bot2, a crime, and "whenever you
# commit a crime, untap this creature" untaps it before the Bolt resolves. Tapped for a second Bolt at Bot2 the same
# turn, it stays tapped: the ability "triggers only once each turn". On Bot2's turn a third Bolt from a Mountain is a
# crime on a new turn, and it untaps again.

